vimala taTaakini) like a queen of swans (maraaLa gaamini), whose hips (madhyae) are like a lion's (kari hara), who shower brightness (bimbaanana) like the Sun and the moon (vidhu manDalare), whose fragrant (parimaLa) bindi (tilakam) is combined (samkalita) with both Chandan and Kumkum, who have thick hair (kacha kucha), who walk like the queen of swans (maraaLa gaamini) among bunches of lotuses (ambhOja): O Goddess!! Shower your blessings on me."]}]}}
